    "updated_at": "2022-02-10T16:50:39Z",
    "body": "I'm just not sure if it does allow not setting `[System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8` as I think even with the `activeCodePage` set powershell might still try to read the output as ANSI as starship doesn't write directly to the console but to a pipe it gives it. Also Rust's stdio handling that tries to handle Unicode by itself might also get in the way.\r\n\r\nAs for `longPathAware` I can add it if you think it will improve the way starship works under long pathsbon Windows, but that's something that needs some testing.",
